    "https://wutheringwaves.kurogames.com official news 965 'Profile Reveal | Thawborn Renewal — Jinhsi': the Jinzhou Magistrate; holds the spark of light, illuminating people's wishes. Lore images: Blessings of Jinzhou Magistrate (the 'Loong Maiden'; after one of her visits, everyone on the street experiences a sudden stroke of luck; people make wishes at the pond outside City Hall for a share in her luck); Signs of Shyness (Resonance Connection with the Sentinel Jué; when she controls time or synchronizes with the Sentinel, a pair of Loong Horns protrude; under strain or severe injury her skin grows Loong Scales; shyness can also evoke them, as when she met the Rover); Visions in the Dream (Jué's gift of prophecy lets her receive visions in dreams; the figure from her dream turned out to be the Rover); Horns of Loong; Cherished Item: Loong Buns she makes herself, with custard, lotus seed paste or sweet bean paste fillings; Resonance Evaluation Report (birthplace Huanglong, Congenital Resonator)",
